Where airport/abi/ and airport/WCL.hpp come from

Copied from laobamac/itlwm (GPL-2.0, LICENSE here), commit
738d4c61b5a64433b27c1ab09dba94916ab77d8d: the Tahoe subset of include/Airport/ and
AirportItlwm/WCL/WCL.hpp. Since then they are this project's files, edited in place;
our changes are marked QWZAIRPORT or QWZMAC. apple80211_var.h, apple80211_ioctl.h and
apple_private_spi.h are Apple's (APSL-2.0, headers kept).

They are trusted only after `python3 scripts/kc-abi.py --check` and `--returns` pass on
the running macOS build (docs/DEPENDENCIES.md).

To compare with the fork (files we did not take show up as "Only in"):
  git clone -q https://github.com/laobamac/itlwm /tmp/itlwm && git -C /tmp/itlwm checkout -q 738d4c6
  diff -ru /tmp/itlwm/include/Airport airport/abi/Airport; diff -u /tmp/itlwm/AirportItlwm/WCL/WCL.hpp airport/WCL.hpp
